### TaxRateSystem - calculator + history smoke tests (API.md §9, §10, §17 Flows 4-5)
### Requires a bearer token: run http/auth.http first (or paste one into @accessToken).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@accessToken = {{accessToken}}

### §9.1 - canonical case: ₱600,000 of personal income -> ₱62,500.00 (201, captures the id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "taxType": "personal_income_tax", "taxableIncome": 600000 }

> {%
    client.global.set("calculationId", response.body.id);
%}

### §9.1 - unknown code -> 422 { "fields": { "taxType": "unknown tax type code" } }
POST {{baseUrl}}/calculations
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "taxType": "gst", "taxableIncome": 1000 }

### §10.1 - history, newest first, paged; optionally filtered by taxType
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculations/history?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### §10.1 - filter by tax type (an unknown value returns an empty page, not 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculations/history?page=0&size=20&sort=createdAt,desc&taxType=personal_income_tax
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### §10.2 - one owned calculation with its full breakdown (another user's id -> 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/calculations/{{calculationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### §10.3 - delete one history entry (204, idempotent)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/calculations/{{calculationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### §10.4 - clear the caller's whole history (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/calculations/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

